[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_04_0010","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_04_0020","text":"诶……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_04_0030","text":"雏菜呢，想要挂满气球的布景～\n还有也想穿新服装～，可爱的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_04_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_04_0040","text":"还想试试飞到空中～，\n喷火的那种！　烟花也不错呢～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_04_0050","text":"做，做得到吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_04_0060","text":"能不能实现呢～？\n那要不，从天花板撒糖果下来！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_04_0070","text":"危、危险啦……！\n会砸到观众的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_04_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_04_0080","text":"啊哈～\n小糸你什么都说不行～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_04_0090","text":"可、可是……！　而且……雏菜同学说的那些\n都是雏菜同学自己想做的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_04_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_04_0100","text":"好像不太算是，为了粉丝……对吧……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_04_0110","text":"应该更多地为粉丝做点什么──……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_04_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_04_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_04_0120","text":"呀～\n拍到了好照片～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_04_0130","text":"等、等一下\n雏菜同学……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_04_0140","text":"雏菜像这样拍拍照\n发到Twister上～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_04_0150","text":"唱唱歌、跳跳舞\n让大家看到雏菜开心幸福的样子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_04_0160","text":"大家看了也觉得幸福～的话\n那不就好了吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_04_0170","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_04_0180","text":"那，小糸你呢～？\n想做什么来着？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_04_0190","text":"…………我、我\n我──……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_04_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_04_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_04_0200","text":"我…………"}]
